  "credit": "VOICEVOX:四国めたん, VOICEVOX:ずんだもん",
  "lines": [
    {
      "line_id": "line-nist-csf-cis-scs-0-0",
      "scene_index": 0,
      "line_index": 0,
      "speaker": "right",
      "emotion": "sad",
      "style_id": 76,
      "voice_preset": "voicevox:76",
      "text": "ゆきり〜、最近お客さんから『うちのセキュリティ、なんの基準で測ればいいの』って聞かれて、答えに困ったのだ。",
      "wav_path": "wavs/scene-00-line-00.wav",
      "wav_bytes": 637996,
      "wav_sha256": "c4d8fa1df1b05ba9036c7e65aeed2e6dc78545b38211001e7c697e52126c10cb",
      "ipfs_cid": "bafybeiap6sluqurhfiqn5qyg2gufusbl4sylz2x5pod42npk6perqs5s6i",
      "duration_synth_sec": 20.51
    },
    {
      "line_id": "line-nist-csf-cis-scs-0-1",
      "scene_index": 0,
      "line_index": 1,
      "speaker": "left",
      "emotion": "normal",
      "style_id": 2,
      "voice_preset": "voicevox:2",
      "text": "ああ、それはよくある悩みね。よく出てくるのが NIST CSF v2、CIS Controls、それから日本の SCS制度の3つ。",
      "wav_path": "wavs/scene-00-line-01.wav",
      "wav_bytes": 589356,
      "wav_sha256": "485722064e10ec8ee3e735eeb9a1f47a3d3310caac010ff48c9d65a804aed963",
      "ipfs_cid": "bafybeih5d3kdiu5vo6lbyx2drbw5rp7eitbijbwggowv2u2sghyzporypq",
      "duration_synth_sec": 16.2
    },
    {
      "line_id": "line-nist-csf-cis-scs-0-2",
      "scene_index": 0,
      "line_index": 2,
      "speaker": "right",
      "emotion": "surprised",
      "style_id": 7,
      "voice_preset": "voicevox:7",
      "text": "3つもあるの！？どれを使えばいいか分からないのだ。",
      "wav_path": "wavs/scene-00-line-02.wav",
      "wav_bytes": 197676,
      "wav_sha256": "19abbb4d732f8e3ace2222253593d2f74030038a9e962b77a9dc11022d80539e",
      "ipfs_cid": "bafkreiazvo5u24zpry5m4irceu2zhuxxiayahcu6syvxpko4cebc3actty",
      "duration_synth_sec": 5.38
    },
    {
      "line_id": "line-nist-csf-cis-scs-0-3",
      "scene_index": 0,
      "line_index": 3,
      "speaker": "left",
      "emotion": "happy",
      "style_id": 0,
      "voice_preset": "voicevox:0",
      "text": "大丈夫。実は3つは戦う相手じゃなくて、役割が違うのよ。今日はそこを整理していきましょう。",
      "wav_path": "wavs/scene-00-line-03.wav",
      "wav_bytes": 389164,
      "wav_sha256": "52ee3512a6c4352ce543384ac127c826bb8feb13c6838786d86efd8509222e62",
      "ipfs_cid": "bafybeie25wwvd6hab4xohfvj5oqgm5tybipjdjmzqpn6rgm5ygtbbtrcou",
      "duration_synth_sec": 9.72
    },
    {
      "line_id": "line-nist-csf-cis-scs-1-0",
      "scene_index": 1,
      "line_index": 0,
      "speaker": "right",
      "emotion": "normal",
      "style_id": 3,
      "voice_preset": "voicevox:3",
      "text": "まず NIST CSF v2 ってなんなのだ？",
      "wav_path": "wavs/scene-01-line-00.wav",
      "wav_bytes": 262188,
      "wav_sha256": "6ff73d4b8c6c663dbd80d8f9529c5d709ceb4ea436942040033cd83bef0bb2a2",
      "ipfs_cid": "bafybeihafemcdz45w4zzgfiv63r46prsxgggkdgsemskwfwla6fabtmmp4",
      "duration_synth_sec": 6.48
    },
    {
      "line_id": "line-nist-csf-cis-scs-1-1",
      "scene_index": 1,
      "line_index": 1,
      "speaker": "left",
      "emotion": "normal",
      "style_id": 2,
      "voice_preset": "voicevox:2",
      "text": "アメリカの NIST が作った『サイバーセキュリティの全体地図』ね。2024年に v2 に更新されて、機能が6つになったの。",
      "wav_path": "wavs/scene-01-line-01.wav",
      "wav_bytes": 618028,
      "wav_sha256": "3ca20bc6fc74463de2f7419bdc5934f0827be7b44f34841e0fa31d54f16dbeb2",
      "ipfs_cid": "bafybeiaxn72ymvfr6edc2h7nnx5xjiu6dswouptvrdbngvfzqs3ferbbxm",
      "duration_synth_sec": 13.66
    },
    {
      "line_id": "line-nist-csf-cis-scs-1-2",
      "scene_index": 1,
      "line_index": 2,
      "speaker": "left",
      "emotion": "normal",
      "style_id": 2,
      "voice_preset": "voicevox:2",
      "text": "識別、防御、検知、対応、復旧の5つに、新しく『ガバナンス』が加わったのが v2 の目玉よ。",
      "wav_path": "wavs/scene-01-line-02.wav",
      "wav_bytes": 500268,
      "wav_sha256": "9afc64cfc868d41c6a2337333efb9c156a81e21529f232c49ea1d75332fa18b7",
      "ipfs_cid": "bafybeifhjbavpm27yffdonsxipeuvjmt4wuvlgudqerckkwowk5vdbrkdy",
      "duration_synth_sec": 11.05
    },
    {
      "line_id": "line-nist-csf-cis-scs-1-3",
      "scene_index": 1,
      "line_index": 3,
      "speaker": "right",
      "emotion": "surprised",
      "style_id": 7,
      "voice_preset": "voicevox:7",
      "text": "ガバナンスっていうのは、経営層がちゃんと関わりなさいよ、ってこと？",
      "wav_path": "wavs/scene-01-line-03.wav",
      "wav_bytes": 284204,
      "wav_sha256": "99f88188026c347d81878501705a0aa3d6ff5fe36d416d38e9cb6047e8c2c0ee",
      "ipfs_cid": "bafybeictjow6xehm2nc2lhopcaw6rj534kbmvhkinjagw3nzjkled4dbii",
      "duration_synth_sec": 7.2
    },
    {
      "line_id": "line-nist-csf-cis-scs-1-4",
      "scene_index": 1,
      "line_index": 4,
      "speaker": "left",
      "emotion": "happy",
      "style_id": 0,
      "voice_preset": "voicevox:0",
      "text": "その通り。技術だけじゃなくて、リスクを誰が決めるか、誰が責任を持つかを地図に描き加えたの。",
      "wav_path": "wavs/scene-01-line-04.wav",
      "wav_bytes": 396332,
      "wav_sha256": "d391a73e512a74206bd07b38030cd4996e061b54b4ca464fea78e779efeff33f",
      "ipfs_cid": "bafybeiayaigeqlvdvlslmaq3kq5p5426kpzuz4gmx74rhuoqlgza6y42by",
      "duration_synth_sec": 9.0
    },
    {
      "line_id": "line-nist-csf-cis-scs-1-5",
      "scene_index": 1,
      "line_index": 5,
      "speaker": "right",
      "emotion": "happy",
      "style_id": 1,
      "voice_preset": "voicevox:1",
      "text": "なるほど〜、地図だから『どこから手を付けるか』を考えるのに使うのだ。",
      "wav_path": "wavs/scene-01-line-05.wav",
      "wav_bytes": 336940,
      "wav_sha256": "8cc31b354708cb343c23f9c3372767a5f0661853c7f61750237a4aa386512eb7",
      "ipfs_cid": "bafybeigqprcvar5qpodonqovqfggrbwhplmpaefldqzdrznfagof3mkpvq",
      "duration_synth_sec": 8.91
    },
    {
      "line_id": "line-nist-csf-cis-scs-2-0",
      "scene_index": 2,
      "line_index": 0,
      "speaker": "right",
      "emotion": "normal",
      "style_id": 3,
      "voice_preset": "voicevox:3",
      "text": "じゃあ CIS Controls はなんなのだ？",
      "wav_path": "wavs/scene-02-line-00.wav",
      "wav_bytes": 230956,
      "wav_sha256": "2b179633f49713b766452579b38e1d3e694e1f17ed9bb1e880780e35cedd9d0a",
      "ipfs_cid": "bafkreiblc6ldh5exco3wmrjfpgzy4hj6nfhb6f7ntoy6radyby245xm5bi",
      "duration_synth_sec": 5.97
    },
    {
      "line_id": "line-nist-csf-cis-scs-2-1",
      "scene_index": 2,
      "line_index": 1,
      "speaker": "left",
      "emotion": "normal",
      "style_id": 2,
      "voice_preset": "voicevox:2",
      "text": "こっちは『具体的に何をやればいいか』の手順書。アメリカの非営利団体 CIS がまとめた、18個の管理策のリストよ。",
      "wav_path": "wavs/scene-02-line-01.wav",
      "wav_bytes": 521260,
      "wav_sha256": "5dd83222688c9472c5b7fa79d456d7ec9cea746cf5cbf0a908224c8ff6acd51e",
      "ipfs_cid": "bafybeifx4ribolvk2k3qj3oaztcebxcjo73ekg4xoxd6cbdfylymdhb65m",
      "duration_synth_sec": 11.8
    },
    {
      "line_id": "line-nist-csf-cis-scs-2-2",
      "scene_index": 2,
      "line_index": 2,
      "speaker": "left",
      "emotion": "normal",
      "style_id": 2,
      "voice_preset": "voicevox:2",
      "text": "資産の棚卸し、ソフトウェアの管理、アクセス制御……みたいに、技術寄りの実装ガイドね。",
      "wav_path": "wavs/scene-02-line-02.wav",
      "wav_bytes": 359468,
      "wav_sha256": "7181f70cdb1378bec5b9614072859fe514dec6a1bee630220bc2b42eb80d0af3",
      "ipfs_cid": "bafybeia2eo2fhe4zrvrom4y5gh4cwtle6ncd6ukrdkjiabztxxyskydd6i",
      "duration_synth_sec": 8.6
    },
    {
      "line_id": "line-nist-csf-cis-scs-2-3",
      "scene_index": 2,
      "line_index": 3,
      "speaker": "right",
      "emotion": "sad",
      "style_id": 76,
      "voice_preset": "voicevox:76",
      "text": "18個もあったら、中小企業は全部できないのだ……。",
      "wav_path": "wavs/scene-02-line-03.wav",
      "wav_bytes": 283692,
      "wav_sha256": "35f182ff389f0d58c721bdb7961c2871c3e0ec2d3993b517519e4d2b734a7ac7",
      "ipfs_cid": "bafybeiazae6sep47ma7wfwn3i2cghhyq5tud2wkmulmfu5mauatnmj2gji",
      "duration_synth_sec": 7.29
    },
    {
      "line_id": "line-nist-csf-cis-scs-2-4",
      "scene_index": 2,
      "line_index": 4,
      "speaker": "left",
      "emotion": "happy",
      "style_id": 0,
      "voice_preset": "voicevox:0",
      "text": "そこで CIS は IG1, IG2, IG3 っていう段階を用意してるの。IG1 は中小企業向けの最低限、56個の対策。ここから始めればいい。",
      "wav_path": "wavs/scene-02-line-04.wav",
      "wav_bytes": 815660,
      "wav_sha256": "ed8a60bb1e62571fd9962e6cc9695c5817f89cbd9be35f1fe39caed067f9e93f",
      "ipfs_cid": "bafybeiaprkjwb3chrl3hxoujhh4lb5ioiea5jzrqopbwcyv7cjmlc47p6e",
      "duration_synth_sec": 16.8
    },
    {
      "line_id": "line-nist-csf-cis-scs-2-5",
      "scene_index": 2,
      "line_index": 5,
      "speaker": "right",
      "emotion": "happy",
      "style_id": 1,
      "voice_preset": "voicevox:1",
      "text": "段階があるなら登りやすいのだ！",
      "wav_path": "wavs/scene-02-line-05.wav",
      "wav_bytes": 148524,
      "wav_sha256": "4a8443aa5a56b3377b47dd0c1ec6c29596d4827130f7b870dbb6e53d4108af17",
      "ipfs_cid": "bafkreickqrb2uwswwm3xwr65bqpmnquvs3kie4jq664hbw5w4u6uccfpc4",
      "duration_synth_sec": 5.74
    },
    {
      "line_id": "line-nist-csf-cis-scs-3-0",
      "scene_index": 3,
      "line_index": 0,
      "speaker": "right",
      "emotion": "normal",
      "style_id": 3,
      "voice_preset": "voicevox:3",
      "text": "3つ目の SCS制度って、日本のやつなのだ？",
      "wav_path": "wavs/scene-03-line-00.wav",
      "wav_bytes": 251948,
      "wav_sha256": "44dee634f40a58d1032d69e670f963272ab92356534978c59dd86a1bd016f9c8",
      "ipfs_cid": "bafkreice33tdj5akldiqgllj4zypsyzhfk4sgvstjf4mlhoynin5afxzza",
      "duration_synth_sec": 8.58
    },
    {
      "line_id": "line-nist-csf-cis-scs-3-1",
      "scene_index": 3,
      "line_index": 1,
      "speaker": "left",
      "emotion": "normal",
      "style_id": 2,
      "voice_preset": "voicevox:2",
      "text": "そう。経産省と IPA が進めている『サプライチェーン強化に向けたセキュリティ対策評価制度』。2026年度から本格運用される予定よ。",
      "wav_path": "wavs/scene-03-line-01.wav",
      "wav_bytes": 603692,
      "wav_sha256": "e259d1422a6803a1089d722304c1422e43d52f1f53aaf104022849c62da4140c",
      "ipfs_cid": "bafybeiclvt4mh22d32zvvtdygwnbqnoj65jj4wssluriryeg55p4ovyrzy",
      "duration_synth_sec": 14.38
    },
    {
      "line_id": "line-nist-csf-cis-scs-3-2",
      "scene_index": 3,
      "line_index": 2,
      "speaker": "left",
      "emotion": "normal",
      "style_id": 2,
      "voice_preset": "voicevox:2",
      "text": "企業が自分のセキュリティ対策を申告して、★1から★5までのラベルを取る仕組み。発注元はラベルで取引先を選びやすくなる。",
      "wav_path": "wavs/scene-03-line-02.wav",
      "wav_bytes": 455724,
      "wav_sha256": "5e17745ded11ddc960bd65961ec8502609e6308a1fa94684c72cb266a3d288af",
      "ipfs_cid": "bafybeiauamzbv6p64smemwvtcibqbnolkddgso4jjgrdgf3q7w4vz3scyq",
      "duration_synth_sec": 11.22
    },
    {
      "line_id": "line-nist-csf-cis-scs-3-3",
      "scene_index": 3,
      "line_index": 3,
      "speaker": "right",
      "emotion": "surprised",
      "style_id": 7,
      "voice_preset": "voicevox:7",
      "text": "なんでそんなものが必要なのだ？",
      "wav_path": "wavs/scene-03-line-03.wav",
      "wav_bytes": 129068,
      "wav_sha256": "b7dbb94523a4846ff976f24ffc83cbaa69b5031cfd21003976e91fae9358d428",
      "ipfs_cid": "bafkreifx3o4uki5eqrx7s5xsj76ihs5kng2qghh5eeads5xjd6xjgwgufa",
      "duration_synth_sec": 4.17
    },
    {
      "line_id": "line-nist-csf-cis-scs-3-4",
      "scene_index": 3,
      "line_index": 4,
      "speaker": "left",
      "emotion": "normal",
      "style_id": 2,
      "voice_preset": "voicevox:2",
      "text": "サプライチェーン攻撃が増えたからね。元請けが下請けのセキュリティを一社ずつ調べるのは大変だから、共通のものさしを国が用意するのよ。",
      "wav_path": "wavs/scene-03-line-04.wav",
      "wav_bytes": 469036,
      "wav_sha256": "32b686304bcfbd7143f9051ad9e8bf95645741146fcb11e092491f1aa016c31d",
      "ipfs_cid": "bafybeih47solyfasziut5vkk5ucwg6w3slunx4krrxl5h3dqwxi4vllobi",
      "duration_synth_sec": 10.8
    },
    {
      "line_id": "line-nist-csf-cis-scs-3-5",
      "scene_index": 3,
      "line_index": 5,
      "speaker": "right",
      "emotion": "happy",
      "style_id": 1,
      "voice_preset": "voicevox:1",
      "text": "見せられるラベルがあるって便利なのだ。",
      "wav_path": "wavs/scene-03-line-05.wav",
      "wav_bytes": 159788,
      "wav_sha256": "10433b44d62facc7ff3f163c21afe7322002adf0f83940e510fd5db18399f4c5",
      "ipfs_cid": "bafkreiaqim5ujvrpvtd76pywhqq27zzseabk34hyhfaokeh5lwyyhgpuyu",
      "duration_synth_sec": 4.81
    },
    {
      "line_id": "line-nist-csf-cis-scs-4-0",
      "scene_index": 4,
      "line_index": 0,
      "speaker": "right",
      "emotion": "normal",
      "style_id": 3,
      "voice_preset": "voicevox:3",
      "text": "結局、3つはどう使い分けるのだ？",
      "wav_path": "wavs/scene-04-line-00.wav",
      "wav_bytes": 176684,
      "wav_sha256": "273e87e08a5d1e55cab61c792c890841013547eda348c43da613e5f7da7e5eb0",
      "ipfs_cid": "bafkreibhh2d6bcs5dzk4vnq4pewisccbae2up3ndjdcd3jqt4x35u7s6wa",
      "duration_synth_sec": 5.54
    },
    {
      "line_id": "line-nist-csf-cis-scs-4-1",
      "scene_index": 4,
      "line_index": 1,
      "speaker": "left",
      "emotion": "normal",
      "style_id": 2,
      "voice_preset": "voicevox:2",
      "text": "層が違うの。NIST CSF v2 は『何を目指すか』の地図。CIS Controls は『どう実装するか』の手順書。SCS制度 は『取引先に見せるラベル』。",
      "wav_path": "wavs/scene-04-line-01.wav",
      "wav_bytes": 786988,
      "wav_sha256": "3fdec599cd8566dfdf6fe5ab93fecaf7633181db7239a315175b40d64956938e",
      "ipfs_cid": "bafybeid7fhddfx4cfgohvjugv6vpci2e2muki64tbpguwbzzdaserpkvze",
      "duration_synth_sec": 17.99
    },
    {
      "line_id": "line-nist-csf-cis-scs-4-2",
      "scene_index": 4,
      "line_index": 2,
      "speaker": "left",
      "emotion": "surprised",
      "style_id": 6,
      "voice_preset": "voicevox:6",
      "text": "面白いのはここからね。SCS制度 の評価項目は、実は NIST CSF と CIS Controls をマッピングして作られているのよ。",
      "wav_path": "wavs/scene-04-line-02.wav",
      "wav_bytes": 634412,
      "wav_sha256": "f7bd39ac05b906a2de9d923226d0e603cf307dcfd621009a742fafa199bdc62b",
      "ipfs_cid": "bafybeidhqkugn73lt46jh2fxqxsrdwpg7pijj2rds5ah4nzelcssdevx34",
      "duration_synth_sec": 14.2
    },
    {
      "line_id": "line-nist-csf-cis-scs-4-3",
      "scene_index": 4,
      "line_index": 3,
      "speaker": "right",
      "emotion": "surprised",
      "style_id": 7,
      "voice_preset": "voicevox:7",
      "text": "ええっ！？じゃあ CIS Controls IG1 を実装してれば、SCS の★も取りやすいってこと！？",
      "wav_path": "wavs/scene-04-line-03.wav",
      "wav_bytes": 531500,
      "wav_sha256": "d698fa798a05aa1be7f018d8e3ff5ef8ca7e08e570c9d2e1ac349a064678ed10",
      "ipfs_cid": "bafybeieoa6b4m4owuwxiwu65fxgiwupv6jzwzjiqkwig5h375sjwcjsdey",
      "duration_synth_sec": 11.89
    },
    {
      "line_id": "line-nist-csf-cis-scs-4-4",
      "scene_index": 4,
      "line_index": 4,
      "speaker": "left",
      "emotion": "happy",
      "style_id": 0,
      "voice_preset": "voicevox:0",
      "text": "そういうこと。3つは別の試験じゃなくて、同じ勉強の表と裏なの。だから順番を間違えなければ、二度手間にならない。",
